{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-07_end","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-07","title":"生死与共","storyCode":"5-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"5bd63ac6ca1701c9cc3e6b3c4e39c759955345eb46e7e3ab99d8218c9fa3cf57","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"将星熊的位置报告给医疗队后，陈继续前进。\n和手下以及诗怀雅通讯完毕后，她与手下汇合，向着近卫局进发。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_emporium"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗队，原大古广场南侧12出口，伤者一名，身份是近卫局高级督察，动作快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"止血了没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你还不清楚我吗。伤口已经好了，但挥盾的话，短时间里还有点问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局的伙计们，他们都没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我们两个掉下了楼。不幸中的万幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你真下定决心，这回不带上我？近卫局里潜伏着的可是整合运动的指挥官，这一定是场恶仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我无所谓。但对你的状态来说，这样更好。你也是这么觉得的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这话有些伤人，但没事，我心里清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"记住，千万当心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动不论从哪个层面上，都比我们估计的弱。但无论他们有多弱，他们都吃下了切尔诺伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，你有个弱点。千万不要，不要，不要沉浸在某个想法里。不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"别因为某种执着就一意孤行。除了你的现在，所有的东西都不配你去战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我就当做是建议，好好收下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"快去治疗，任务完成之后，我等你归队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我会保护医疗队的安全。你快去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动已经经过铜钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下环同样有整合运动聚集，正在整队。这是AU7的任务简报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"AO3小队已照既定计划清理了前湾的整合运动，正逼迫残余势力退向近卫局方向，完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已全歼太羯宫的所有整合运动。正撤向查理士大道，前往既定地点汇合。AL1小队汇报完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以上为整合运动行迹与各小队进程通报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"通报完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"继续行动。目标，将所有整合运动全都赶到指定区域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果还有盘踞在其他区域的小股整合运动势力，允许直接消灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可以的话，引诱他们出动。注意把伤亡比控制在最低。我们需要保存实力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Yes sir。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？又有通讯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":true,"text":"喂，喂？阿陈吗？你还在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿陈啊。你完了！大古广场这事儿你死定了，我听得清清楚楚，你叫他们动手的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会就想说这个吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，你拒绝罗德岛的协助，是不是因为心里过意不去啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别揣测我的心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我会帮你弥补的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"弥补什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，暂时还是个秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但大古广场这事儿，你真的完蛋了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你记不记得上环有家茶餐厅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？哪家？哎不管是哪家，现在都关门了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——你是不是很想岔开话题？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"三文治里肉排很酥的那家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？哦......哦！我想起来了！那家的茶餐厅，肉扒包是不是有两个手掌大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"以前巡逻的时候，我也经常往这家店跑呢......躺下！谁让你站起来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"叫什么来着，“靓饮茶餐厅？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，我知道了，你是准备喊我饮茶，是不是？不过我们为什么不去点高档店？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的高档和我的高档区别很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我可以请你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"诗小姐，我像那种人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你再这么叫我试试？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别介意，口误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你明摆着故意的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"诗怀雅，其实我是觉得，如果这次我们不做好点，会对不起街坊邻居。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的事业仰仗着龙门，龙门也仰仗着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"有感而发也该适可而止吧，你早点把整合运动干掉，我们就能早点去喫茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你那里的战斗好像很激烈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没事，我拿得住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"快！他们要逃走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"烦人！喂，你们几个动作也快点！没时间了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿陈！我要番茄扒蛋堡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"上次一不小心把你关在金库那事，我向你赔罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那也能是一不小心？！算了，你肯定是存心的！算了，早上那杯水我泼得很解气，两清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，阿陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"命最重要。不要为了眼前事把命搭上，你还有很多人可以依靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，是吗。谢谢你的忠告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这家茶餐厅门口了，也就说明你快到近卫局大楼了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你好运。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"07:40 P.M.  天气/阴\n龙门上城区，上厂街，近卫局大楼东侧670m处"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir，第四机动小队向你报到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位，我们现在已经集结了一支精锐的队伍。许多同事还在我们看不见的地方奋战着，但我们有自己的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们面前的大楼，曾是龙门安全的象征，法律的实体，龙门近卫局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，它被整合运动攫取了，沦陷在阴谋战火中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"对于各位而言，也许这只是工作；又或许这件事触动了你的感情；甚至，这让你义愤填膺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_5_6_police"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但无论如何，我们都是近卫局，我们不是暴徒，不是罪犯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要夺回近卫局，未必是出于尊严或者正义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是龙门近卫局，我们拿回属于我们自己的东西，这已经足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不要让龙门为我们担忧。记住了吗！服从，尽职，坚定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是时候了，就让我们去摧毁近卫局里的所有整合运动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes sir！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"出发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["？？？","诗怀雅","陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["诗怀雅"]}]}
